# Test-only client key material (generated, not committed).

Run from `sandbox/`:

```bash
./scripts/generate-keys.sh
```

| File | Passphrase |
|------|------------|
| `id_ed25519` | _(none)_ |
| `id_ed25519_passphrase` | `lab-passphrase` |

Never use these keys on a real host. Password for every lab user remains `easy`.
